       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SANKTIONSDETEKTION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 KUNDE.
           COPY "DataStruktur/KundeOplysning.cpy".
       01 END-OF-KUNDER        PIC X   VALUE "N".

       01 SANKTION.
           COPY "DataStruktur/SanktionsOplysning.cpy".
       01 END-OF-SANKTIONER    PIC X   VALUE "N".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       TEST-AF-READKUNDEINFO.
       PERFORM 10 TIMES
           CALL 'READKUNDEINFO' USING REFERENCE KUNDE END-OF-KUNDER
           DISPLAY KUNDE-ID SPACE NAVN OF KUNDE
       END-PERFORM

       CALL 'READKUNDEINFO' USING CONTENT KUNDE "Y".

       TEST-AF-READSANKTIONSINFO.
       PERFORM 10 TIMES
           CALL 'READSANKTIONSINFO' USING 
               REFERENCE SANKTION END-OF-SANKTIONER
           DISPLAY SANKTION-ID SPACE NAVN OF SANKTION
                   SPACE ALIAS OF ALIAS-LIST(1)
       END-PERFORM

       CALL 'READSANKTIONSINFO' USING CONTENT SANKTION "Y".

       STOP RUN.
